{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Armor & Helmets|$Helms & Helmets|Drag$on Helm}}

The Dragon Helmet (often referred to in the community colloquially as 'dhelm') is one of the costliest items to make in the game, requiring [[Gold Nugget]]s, [[Silver Nugget]]s and even [[Bar of Steel|Steel Bars]]. 

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}BronzeNugget + _{q}Steel}{2} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[4]{Will*Psyche*Smithing*Lore}</math>

